<title>JAPAN: Japan agriculture minister leaves for Europe.</title>
<headline>Japan agriculture minister leaves for Europe.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Agriculture Minister Takao Fujimoto will meet with European policy makers to discuss farm-related issues during a week-long visit starting from Thursday, a spokesman for the ministry said.</p>
<p>During his visit, Fujimoto will meet with World Trade Organisation Director-General Renato Ruggiero in Geneva and EU Farm Commissioner Franz Fischler in Brussels, he said.</p>
<p>The ministry spokesman did not provide further details.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
